### Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

### Ingest the PDFs in data/pdfs
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/ingest?reset=true

### Ask a general question
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What equipment do I need for olive oil production?",
  "k": 4
}

### Ask with a metadata filter
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "How can I package food products better?",
  "k": 4,
  "filters": {
    "doc_type": "forum"
  }
}
